{"name": "Rising Fox", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rising Fox</strong> is a 2D action-exploration metroidvania where you play as a small fox on an adventure full of challenges, secrets, and abilities to uncover. Explore ancient ruins, face unique enemies, and unlock new ways to move as you traverse a charmingly hand-crafted pixel art world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by genre classics, <strong>Rising Fox</strong> combines tight platforming, agile combat, and skill-based progression. As you advance, new tools will let you access hidden areas, solve environmental challenges, and face increasingly dangerous bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"96\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832050/extras/3d7852b3ed72ba8b8106a7fffe0fa11a.avif?t=1788316390\" width=\"480\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interconnected world in true metroidvania style</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a nimble and expressive fox</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"384\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832050/extras/e1b2ffd7e1c0ebf9d17f069d8a68ab0e.poster.avif?t=1788316390\" width=\"1128\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3832050/extras/e1b2ffd7e1c0ebf9d17f069d8a68ab0e.webm?t=1788316390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"